 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_2d51ef7bd0f589f46f8a",
   "sourceHash": "2d51ef7bd0f589f46f8ac2ae0a240771ca6304bae961278ccdc3cef1f6062c35",
   "text": "第一部分专注于呼吸（调息法，Pranayama）与冥想。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_73dbf69b7c7a2c8327ec",
   "sourceHash": "73dbf69b7c7a2c8327ecbb7667c9717434cacc7cfe72c71ad81846a9972ecdbf",
   "text": "第二部分为流瑜伽（Vinyasa Yoga）的动态练习，由呼吸引导您的动作。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7a5436f79fb2bbec7396",
   "sourceHash": "7a5436f79fb2bbec73960a12c05d3b9bfe02f137338b57716cc1d04ad8258e6d",
   "text": "第三部分为阴瑜伽，我们将针对结缔组织进行练习，以深层补水、排毒并焕活身体。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source typos ('wok', 'hydratate') read as 'work', 'hydrate'."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3574175cbba9c755b5be",
   "sourceHash": "3574175cbba9c755b5bea3efe9097247ad25ea8ffd480c915216072adc0bbf68",
   "text": "最后一部分则是深度放松（摊尸式，Shavasana）。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ff603898405d24a4611f",
   "sourceHash": "ff603898405d24a4611fc9775815051d4fd23cae0af2cce446d99924fc0216dd",
   "text": "Kairali Ayurvedic Group 的标志性院区“阿育吠陀疗愈村”是一处自然天堂，您可以在此舒缓压力与疲劳、接受针对自身病症的治疗，同时享受惬意的住院时光。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'holiday' substituted with 住院时光 (stay) per language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c32feba8ad7eef80d3ba",
   "sourceHash": "c32feba8ad7eef80d3baf8e1e2a58e2ae814d3c707695ce321421eb5af2af24b",
   "text": "这处阿育吠陀疗养之所位于帕拉卡德（Palakkad），距离喀拉拉邦与泰米尔纳德邦之间世界上最大的山口仅几公里。大自然赋予帕拉卡德丰富的天然植被、群山、森林、肥沃的河谷、河流与山涧，构成一幅壮丽的全景画卷。在这片独特的天地中停留，您将能够体验古印度正宗的疗愈方法，同时在现代整体式的舒适环境中放松身心。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'luxury' substituted with 舒适 (comfort) per language lock. Legacy claim 'world's biggest mountain pass' kept as in source; not verified."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8d43370033d9a31ca92e",
   "sourceHash": "8d43370033d9a31ca92ea65210bf9c5d6b55ffd266d2cc05283a3900a1fd3168",
